# Keep the build context small and free of secrets/local cruft.
.git/
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
data/
output/
logs/
*.log
.env
.env.*
.mcp.json
# .claude/ holds LOCAL CONFIG (OAuth tokens - never ship) but also the
# candidate-communication SOPs that the drafter now reads at runtime. Exclude
# everything under it EXCEPT that one skill folder. Excluding the whole
# directory is why the build failed with:
#   failed to compute cache key: "/.claude/skills/01_candidate-communication": not found
.claude/*
!.claude/skills
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/01_candidate-communication
!.claude/skills/02_candidate-evaluation
!.claude/skills/03_operations
!.claude/skills/04_data-and-systems
!.claude/skills/05_talent-sourcing
!.claude/skills/06_candidate-invites
!.claude/skills/07_contract-drafting
# ui-ux-pro-max is deliberately NOT shipped: it is vendored third-party design
# guidance, local-only, and Rule 9 bars it from the locked candidate layouts.
# It is the one skill folder that is not part of Coco's own method.
archive/
*.bak
C:/tmp
design-system/
docs/
SESSIONS.md
